+具體輸入：
+
+```json
+{"type":"item.started","item":{"type":"command_execution","command":"cat scripts/lumos"}}
+{"type":"turn.completed"}
+```
+
+執行路徑：
+
+```text
+run_one_codex → source_evidence → grade → summarize_results
